<p>
to the <code>use-package</code> for <code>define-word</code>. That&rsquo;s just a copy of the definition of <code>define-word-services</code> from the <code>define-word</code> source. Note that it&rsquo;s important that it goes in the <code>:init</code> section so that the definition gets established before <code>define-word</code> is loaded.
</p>
<p>
It&rsquo;s a messy solution but it will do until the fix is merged and percolates up to MELPA.</p>
